WEBVTT

00:00.085 --> 00:05.068
order-saga failed. The banner names the task and the reason, as a code and in words.

00:05.068 --> 00:12.358
View stderr opens the failed task’s own output: the API answered 503.

00:12.358 --> 00:19.406
How it failed lists what ran and what never started. Seen before counts failures like it.

00:19.406 --> 00:25.170
The failure handlers released and refunded the order. The run still ends Failed.

00:25.170 --> 00:30.858
Fix the cause, then Run again.
